0..80 Comment "//! Univalence at the certified strata of a signature: `ua[n, k]` derives a path"
81..158 Comment "//! between two models\' degree telescopes up to degree `n` over the shapes of"
159..239 Comment "//! size at most `k` whose every vertex is a corolla the two signatures inhabit,"
240..279 Comment "//! each stage over its matching object"
280..359 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]. From degree"
360..440 Comment "//! two the Segal condition certifies the stages above the corollas; a degree, a"
441..520 Comment "//! bound or a table the stratum does not certify is refused by name, and so is"
521..584 Comment "//! a bound holding more shape classes than the stratum budget."
585..588 Comment "//!"
589..664 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
665..668 Comment "//!"
669..845 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000565 \"Shulman, Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity\""
